{"name": "Wordbound", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious event called The Scramble has vanished pieces of reality and left strange, out-of-place objects scattered across the world. Use your powers as a wordsmith to fix it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/extras/dcb1b9398972c1830f23d3c3d3552fb9.poster.avif?t=1784321466\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/extras/dcb1b9398972c1830f23d3c3d3552fb9.webm?t=1784321466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/extras/dcb1b9398972c1830f23d3c3d3552fb9.mp4?t=1784321466\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stretch objects until they burst into letter tiles, rearrange tiles to spell new words, and squish words to create objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of handcrafted objects to create and discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of detailed dioramas full of hidden clues and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and intuitive drag and drop controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over forty collectable Sparks scattered across multiple chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack by Adrian Talens, composer of Poly Bridge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/extras/2c749afe87c97bc318f5007f55d4e090.poster.avif?t=1784321466\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/extras/2c749afe87c97bc318f5007f55d4e090.webm?t=1784321466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/extras/2c749afe87c97bc318f5007f55d4e090.mp4?t=1784321466\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Wordbound is a cozy puzzle game where you transform words into objects to repair a scrambled world. Explore vibrant dioramas full of hidden clues and bring new words to life by arranging magical letter tiles. Discover thousands of handcrafted objects as you become a master wordsmith!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073540/bf63fcc59faf24b0f5384d840c6a1abfc1c59a05/header.jpg?t=1784321466", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Puzzle", "Relaxing", "Sandbox", "Word Game", "Cute"], "developers": "Kettle Games", "publishers": "Kettle Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4073540", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/C0agglONPN8", "first_seen": 1784239200.0, "review_rank": 271}